  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/255308/description_c4372955-c8ad-4b7f-b5a6-7696cca9bfad.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"262\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/commits-since/Gilded-Games/The-Aether/1.14.4-0.0.1?color=22272E&label=commits&logo=github&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/Gilded-Games/The-Aether?color=22272E&label=issues&logo=github&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-pr-raw/Gilded-Games/The-Aether?color=22272E&label=pull requests&logo=github&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=TheAetherTeam&type=pledges&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&logo=discord&color=7289DA&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.aether.devaether.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/crowdin-aether-blue?color=55BC5C&label=crowdin&logo=crowdin&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&style=flat-square&color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&logoSource=feather&style=flat-square&color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&label=youtube&logo=youtube&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&label=reddit&logo=reddit&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 關於天界（Aether）☁️<br></strong></span></h2>\n<p>天界團隊為您帶來原版天界模組！為現代版 Minecraft 持續維護並更新，完全支援多人遊戲！</p>\n<p>天界是一座高聳於雲端的維度，充滿了廣闊的<strong>天空大陸</strong>與<strong>浮空島嶼</strong>。此維度提供全新的生存冒險體驗，以類似原版遊戲的<strong>生存進度系統</strong>為核心，包含<strong>新礦物</strong>、<strong>神話生物</strong>以及<strong>三座危險迷宮</strong>，每座迷宮都有專屬的<strong>強力戰利品</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 模組內容概覽☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>天界包含許多全新可探索的功能，大多數內容已在 <a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1275355-1-7-3-aether-collaboration-mod-v1-02-new-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether 合作模組</a> 的原版論壇貼文中說明。以下是內容簡要介紹：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>天空中的敵意天堂：天界維度！請務必小心不要掉下去，否則您會回到主世界。</li>\n<li>從該維度本身即可取得一系列全新方塊與物品。</li>\n<li>3 種實用方塊：祭壇、冷凍機與孵化機。</li>\n<li>4 種材料階級：天根木、聖石、贊尼特礦與重力礦，各自擁有具備獨特能力的工具與武器。</li>\n<li>知識之書，收錄模組內所有方塊與物品的詳細條目。</li>\n<li>配件系統，配備獨特介面，讓您能運用所發現的戰利品。</li>\n<li>既有令人聯想到主世界的生物，也有天界獨有的生物。</li>\n<li>莫亞鳥（Moas）：一種可飛行的騎乘生物，分為不同階級，跳躍次數各異。</li>\n<li>3 座全新待征服的建築：銅迷宮、銀迷宮與金迷宮，各自擁有專屬裝備可供搜刮與首領需擊敗。</li>\n<li>永晝：唯有在征服最終迷宮後才能結束，之後便可透過獨特實用方塊「太陽祭壇」來控制晝夜循環。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252faether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/255308/description_b9ff2a53-d0c1-4bb9-b5a1-fe05b6e238ec.png\"></a></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"></pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 入門指南☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>要開始探索天界，您必須使用<strong>螢石框架</strong>搭建傳送門，並在中央用<strong>水桶</strong>點亮。這將激活傳送門，讓您得以踏入其中進入該維度。從此，您便能在天界的敵意天堂中展開生存之旅！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"387\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 攻略迷宮☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>天界的世界包含三座全新的神秘迷宮，每座都有一位令人畏懼的首領等待您擊敗……</p>\n<p><strong>銅迷宮</strong>是守衛者的棲息地，由詭譎的<strong>滑行者</strong>守護，這是一種純由岩石構成的生物。請留意島嶼間的隱藏通道，並準備好您能打造的最佳裝備！</p>\n<p><strong>銀迷宮</strong>是美麗的瓦爾基里神殿。挑戰瓦爾基里騎士團的騎士，若您證明自己有資格，將直接對抗<strong>瓦爾基里女王</strong>本人。請善用一切工具與技巧來擊敗這位古代戰士。</p>\n<p>在稀有的<strong>金迷宮</strong>深處，沉眠著<strong>太陽精靈</strong>，一位由純粹火焰與能量構成的永恆存在。他是統治太陽本身的神明，想要引起他的注意尚需一番說服。但據傳他看守著天界中最頂級的寶藏之一。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"356\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 即將推出☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faetherlegends.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/refs/heads/main/images/legends.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"7680\" height=\"2160\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 加入討論☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>歡迎加入我們的 Discord 伺服器，與超過一萬名成員的活躍社群暢聊！</p>\n<p>對開發者有疑問？需要協助設定模組？發現了錯誤？我們為天界模組設有專屬的支援與開發頻道！或者您只是想聊聊模組，或是官方伺服器上的遊玩活動？天界 Discord 就是您的最佳去處！我們友善的工作人員與熱情的社群將讓您有賓至如歸的感覺！<a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 支持天界團隊☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>沒有您的支持，就無法完成天界模組的開發。請考慮贊助以協助資助開發！每一筆贊助都将直接投入開發工作，讓我們能繼續致力於最熱愛的事。<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 參與專案貢獻☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>想為天界模組貢獻力量嗎？天界採用開源模式，意味著任何有興趣的人都能提交程式碼來協助專案！更多相關資訊請見我們的 <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/README.md#wrench-contribute-to-the-project\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 倉庫</a>。</p>\n<p>我們也透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.aether.devaether.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a> 接受專案翻譯，讓更多玩家能夠體驗天界！</p>\n<p>我們的 <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/README.md#speech_balloon-translations\" rel=\"nofollow\">翻譯</a> 與程式碼 <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/CREDITS.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">貢獻</a> 名單均可在 GitHub 倉庫中查看。</p>",
